@startuml
title ALOUTE - Sequence Cập nhật hồ sơ (phần Khôi)

actor User
boundary "Profile UI" as UI
control "JwtAuthenticationFilter" as JwtFilter
control "CurrentUserProvider" as CurrentUser
control "UserController" as Controller
control "UserProfileService" as Service
database "UserRepository" as UserRepo
database "ProfileRepository" as ProfileRepo
database "Relational DB" as DB

User -> UI: Chỉnh thông tin hồ sơ
UI -> JwtFilter: PATCH /api/users/me/profile\nCookie aloute_access_token
JwtFilter -> JwtFilter: Verify JWT + build SecurityContext

alt JWT hợp lệ
    JwtFilter -> Controller: request authenticated
    Controller -> CurrentUser: requireUserId()
    CurrentUser --> Controller: currentUserId
    Controller -> Service: updateCurrentProfile(currentUserId, request)
    Service -> UserRepo: findById(currentUserId)
    UserRepo -> DB: SELECT user
    DB --> UserRepo: User
    Service -> ProfileRepo: findById(currentUserId)
    ProfileRepo -> DB: SELECT profile
    DB --> ProfileRepo: Profile
    Service -> Service: Validate + update allowed fields
    Service -> DB: UPDATE User/Profile in transaction
    Service --> Controller: ProfileResponse
    Controller --> UI: 200 ProfileEnvelope
else JWT thiếu/không hợp lệ
    JwtFilter --> UI: 401 ErrorEnvelope
end

note over Service
avatarMediaId thuộc Media module.
Phần Khôi không tự tạo Media/Firebase implementation.
end note
@enduml
